LsMo9chrDBSZFjErJ8PjUvwRN8YYcsR1gA&oe=6A19BC99"}, {"file_name": "Rhizomat_ScreenShots_03.png", "id": "735894278860861", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499327010_735894282194194_554594768329450585_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E1yLzlUc2NIQ7kNvwHGQIDt&_nc_oc=AdriOhIOKmK8tqx-w6sxIK4AxieO8PfNycQiaeOvePbTrBHw_Go4eGgEyjmDxWNRr-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5MwK0aI3CvU7zvWaFSzik83VjPHKcBCqRxJpadHiWfAw&oe=6A19BFD4"}, {"file_name": "Rhizomat_ScreenShots_04.png", "id": "10010033185731188", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499320953_10010033195731187_1033932675632698971_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gmdFKTAkWgwQ7kNvwFxOjvr&_nc_oc=AdpE8HP1_vVOc7RW3bqIU0Is6vb59FOK-cZUVDdWqfWHhj9mVAc43nsBT36tdMjzMCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6vVnbn41utX6Eubm5a45aZfo-zR8xhgC6tzHsboaprdw&oe=6A19BEAF"}, {"file_name": "Rhizomat_ScreenShots_05.png", "id": "1649125629106120", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499357865_1649125632439453_2503025008738710840_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FehcJoo7uCEQ7kNvwESlREr&_nc_oc=AdoCPY_BiMQ_33mfk1_RXUSfPR9ZFegmc0GTTFqvclmaNXLP2gwK79Xf1CsUCWp4yNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6e4nPugoTeI2C5IRmJRxDEtglrKYbmBV0EkY9X-sAU9A&oe=6A199EED"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rhizomat", "keywords": ["Fiction", "Rhizomat", "Dystopia", "Futuristic", "SciFi"], "long_description": "The 360\u00b0 experience \u201cRHIZOMAT\u201d extends the Narrative Space \u201cRHIZOMAT\u201d, built by the artist Mona el Gammal, from physical into digital space. In the world of \u201cRHIZOMAT\u201d, the Institut f\u00fcr Methode (IFM), a global private company, has replaced the state and suppresses and monitors people with the promise of security and stability, down to the minutest areas of their life. The underground group Rhizomat, whose members push ahead in research into an alternative social order in individual cells, as well as organising practical resistance, rebels against the totalitarian IFM. Rhizomat has set itself the task of snatching those whose free will has not been completely extinguished from the dictatorial system. The regular mind control tests by the IFM are used by Rhizomat to set up alliances. Between dystopia and utopia, obedience and freedom, a struggle develops for each individual.\n\n\u201cRHIZOMAT VR\u201d is the pilot project of a cooperation between ARTE and Berliner\nFestspiele / Immersion. The film, which was co-produced with INVR.SPACE, explores the artistic potential of connecting theatrical forms with new technological possibilities. At the same time, the film reviews the new medium with criticism and reflection, thereby leading the way to the development of virtual reality as a medium of art. Welcome to the Institut f\u00fcr Methode.", "short_description": "In the world of \u201cRhizomat\u201d, the Institute for Method (IFM), a global private company, has replaced the state and suppresses and monitors people with regular standard examinations. But the standard examinations do not always go according to plan."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1934898560472326", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rhizomat", "keywords": ["fiction", "rhizomat", "Dystopie", "Futuristisch", "SciFi"], "long_description": "Die VR Experience \"RHIZOMAT\" erweitert den von der K\u00fcnstlerin Mona el Gammal gebauten Narrative Space \"RHIZOMAT\" vom physischen in den digitalen Raum. In der Welt des RHIZOMAT hat das Institut f\u00fcr Methode (IFM), ein weltweites Privatunternehmen, den Staat ersetzt und unterdr\u00fcckt und \u00fcberwacht die Menschen mit dem Versprechen von Sicherheit und Stabilit\u00e4t bis in die kleinsten Lebensbereiche ihres Lebens. Die Untergrundgruppe Rhizomat, deren Mitglieder die Erforschung einer alternativen sozialen Ordnung in einzelnen Zellen vorantreiben und praktischen Widerstand organisieren, rebelliert gegen die totalit\u00e4re IFM. Rhizomat hat es sich zur Aufgabe gemacht, diejenigen zu entf\u00fchren, deren freier Wille nicht vollst\u00e4ndig aus dem diktatorischen System gel\u00f6scht wurde. Die regul\u00e4ren Gedankenkontrolltests des IFM werden von Rhizomat verwendet, um Allianzen zu gr\u00fcnden. Zwischen Dystopie und Utopie, Gehorsam und Freiheit entwickelt sich f\u00fcr jeden einzelnen ein Kampf.\n\n\u201eRHIZOMAT VR\u201c ist das Pilotprojekt einer Kooperation zwischen arte/ZDF und Berliner Festspiele/Immersion. Der 360\u00b0 Film, der mit INVR.SPACE koproduziert wurde, untersucht das k\u00fcnstlerische Potenzial, Theaterformen mit neuen technologischen M\u00f6glichkeiten zu verbinden. Zugleich rezensiert der Film das neue Medium mit Kritik und Reflexion und f\u00fchrt damit den Weg zur Entwicklung der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t als Kunstmedium. Willkommen im Institut f\u00fcr Methode.", "short_description": "In der Welt von \u201eRhizomat\u201c hat das Institut f\u00fcr Methode (IFM), ein weltweit t\u00e4tiges Privatunternehmen, den Staat abgel\u00f6st und unterdr\u00fcckt und \u00fcberwacht die Menschen durch regelm\u00e4\u00dfige Standarduntersuchungen. Doch die Standarduntersuchungen verlaufen nicht immer nach Plan."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://invr.space/app-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "INVR.SPACE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://invr.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", 